+/**
+ * Ordered transport-neutral event emitted by one collaboration session.
+ *
+ * <p>Semantic workflow state is carried as an immutable {@link Workflow} snapshot. HTTP adapters may
+ * derive renderer-specific projections from it, while the collaboration package stays independent
+ * of editor and visualization